<title>USA: U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA report of frozen concentrated orange juice stocks in cold storage, in 1000s of units:</p>
<p>    -	  04/30/97	03/31/97---(Previous)   04/30/96</p>
<p> Gallons	201,551	 177,792     175,852     145,905</p>
<p> Lbs	  1,994,551     1,759,432   1,740,235   1,443,874</p>
<p>Note-FCOJ stocks are based on 42.0 degrees Brix equivalent of 9.896 lbs per gallon.</p>
<p>USDA officials said frozen orange juice stocks were at their highest level ever since records began in 1949. The previous high was 1.865 billion pounds in April 1995.</p>
</text>
